	(text "The zener diode & ideal diode exist because the calculator can still be connected to\nthe hideous OE AC-charger. THis device emits a nasty +6V rectified AC towards what it sees\nas 'the battery' - meaning the LiPo-charger's output would see this if we didn't\nprevent that by clamping it to 5.1V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 192.278 34.798 0)
		(effects
			(font
